==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|sla-pro|sh}} {{m|sla-pro|*jebati}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|sh}} {{m|ine-pro|*h₃yebʰ-}}. Cognate with Ancient Greek {{term|οἴφω|tr=oíphō|lang=grc}}, Sanskrit {{term|यभति|tr=yabhati|lang=sa}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/jěbati/|lang=sh}}
* {{hyphenation|je|ba|ti|lang=sh}}

===Verb===
{{sh-verb|head=jèbati|r|јебати|јѐбати|a=pf-impf}}

# {{context|transitive|vulgar|lang=sh}} to [[fuck]]
#: {{usex|jebao sam je c(ij)elo ljeto/leto|t=I was fucking her for the whole summer|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|jebao sam je divlje u anusni otvor sve do zore|t=I kept fucking her in the ass until dawn|lang=sh|inline=1}}
# {{context|reflexive|vulgar|lang=sh}} to have [[sexual]] [[relationship]]s with somebody
#: {{usex|jebemo se kao zečevi kad god stignemo|t=we fuck like rabbits whenever we can|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|njih dvoje se jebu|t=the two of them are having [regular] sex|lang=sh|inline=1}}
# {{context|transitive|vulgar|figuratively|lang=sh}} to [[bother]], [[pest]], [[annoy]]
#: {{usex|nemoj me jebati više!|t=stop fucking with me!|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|c(ij)elo vr(ij)eme dok sam vozio jebao me sa svojim sranjima|t=all the way while I was driving he was bothering me with his shit|lang=sh|inline=1}}
# {{context|transitive|vulgar|figuratively|lang=sh}} not to [[pay attention]], not to [[give a flying fuck]]
#: {{usex|ja joj pričam a ona me ne jebe|t=I keep talking to her and she doesn't give a fuck|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|ne jebe me ni 2 posto!|t=[he/she] doesn't give a flying fuck about me|lang=sh|inline=1}}
# {{non-gloss definition|figurative and idiomatic senses}}
#: {{usex|jebi ga!|t=fuck it!|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|nek se jebe|t=he/she can go fuck himself/herself|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|(t)ko te jebe!|t=who gives a shit about you!|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|ni(t)ko te ne jebe|t=nobody gives a shit about you|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|možeš ga/se jebati|t=there is nothing you can do|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|jebe mi se|t=I don't give a crap|lang=sh|inline=1}}

